      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "- The SHA it last synced (for the UI, not the logic).\n- Sync status: Synced / OutOfSync.\n- Health: Healthy / Progressing / Degraded.\n- selfHeal: someone kubectl edits prod ->\n  OutOfSync -> Argo puts Git's version back.",
      "fontSize": 16,
      "fontFamily": 1,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "- The SHA it last synced (for the UI, not the logic).\n- Sync status: Synced / OutOfSync.\n- Health: Healthy / Progressing / Degraded.\n- selfHeal: someone kubectl edits prod ->\n  OutOfSync -> Argo puts Git's version back.",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
